<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11505" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαρα-χώρητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not giving ground, staunch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.61.3
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, διακεῖσθαι περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.106.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>refusing to retire, unyielding,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ. τῆς ἐξουσίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					10.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλαρχία ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10.54
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.10a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>not permitted,</i> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				5.416
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
